{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000147099","approvedSymbol":"HDAC8","functionDescriptions":["Histone deacetylase that catalyzes the deacetylation of lysine residues on the N-terminal part of the core histones (H2A, H2B, H3 and H4) (PubMed:10748112, PubMed:10922473, PubMed:10926844, PubMed:14701748, PubMed:28497810). Histone deacetylation gives a tag for epigenetic repression and plays an important role in transcriptional regulation, cell cycle progression and developmental events (PubMed:10748112, PubMed:10922473, PubMed:10926844, PubMed:14701748). Histone deacetylases act via the formation of large multiprotein complexes (PubMed:10748112, PubMed:10922473, PubMed:10926844, PubMed:14701748). Also involved in the deacetylation of cohesin complex protein SMC3 regulating release of cohesin complexes from chromatin (PubMed:22885700). May play a role in smooth muscle cell contractility (PubMed:15772115). In addition to protein deacetylase activity, also has protein-lysine deacylase activity: acts as a protein decrotonylase by mediating decrotonylation ((2E)-butenoyl) of histones (PubMed:28497810). {ECO:0000269|PubMed:10748112, ECO:0000269|PubMed:10922473, ECO:0000269|PubMed:10926844, ECO:0000269|PubMed:14701748, ECO:0000269|PubMed:15772115, ECO:0000269|PubMed:22885700, ECO:0000269|PubMed:28497810}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"Q9BY41","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A3B3IRI9","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3IRJ3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3IRJ8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3IRP8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3IRZ0","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3IRZ8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3IS08","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3IS37","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3IS68","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3IS93","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3ISB8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3ISE4","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3ISG7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A3B3ISJ4","source":